OL,3,ASouthport killer accused of throwing
OL,4,Aboiling water mixed with sugar at
OL,5,Aprison officer
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouthport killer Axel Rudakubana
OL,8,Fallegedly threw boiling water mixed
OL,9,Fwith sugar at a prison officer, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FThe 20-year-old, who is serving life
OL,13,Fsentences for murdering three children
OL,14,Fat a dance class in Southport in July
OL,15,F2024, appeared via video link at
OL,16,FWestminster Magistrates' Court from
OL,17,FBroadmoor secure psychiatric hospital
OL,18,Fon Monday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
