OL,3,ASouthport killer accused of throwing
OL,4,Aboiling water mixed with sugar at
OL,5,Aprison officer
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is charged with the attempted
OL,8,Fgrievous bodily harm of a prison
OL,9,Fofficer at HMP Belmarsh, having
OL,10,Fallegedly thrown the boiling mix
OL,11,Fthrough the hatch in his cell door on 8
OL,12,FMay last year.
OL,14,FRudakubana is also charged with two
OL,15,Fother assaults of prison officers, as
OL,16,Fwell as possession of a knife or other
OL,17,Foffensive weapon in prison.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
